WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.557
Unit seventeen. Safe Around Animals!

2
00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:08.004
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.054 --> 00:00:11.145
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.195 --> 00:00:14.952
Today we learn about Safe Around Animals. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.073 --> 00:00:19.407
Dog. Say it with me. Dog!

6
00:00:22.928 --> 00:00:26.078
Cat. Say it with me. Cat!

7
00:00:29.587 --> 00:00:32.854
Bite. Say it with me. Bite!

8
00:00:36.337 --> 00:00:40.053
Scratch. Say it with me. Scratch!

9
00:00:43.561 --> 00:00:47.161
Gentle. Say it with me. Gentle!

10
00:00:50.665 --> 00:00:53.965
Ask. Say it with me. Ask!

11
00:00:57.465 --> 00:01:00.898
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

12
00:01:04.395 --> 00:01:07.779
Adult. Say it with me. Adult!

13
00:01:11.283 --> 00:01:20.826
I ask an adult before I touch a dog or cat. I am gentle and never pull their tails. If an animal bites or scratches me, I wash it and tell an adult right away.

14
00:01:20.876 --> 00:01:22.103
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.419 --> 00:01:28.710
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:29.910
Bite!

17
00:01:30.615 --> 00:01:35.985
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.035 --> 00:01:37.185
Wash!

19
00:01:38.049 --> 00:01:43.799
Did you know? Any animal bite should be washed with soap and water and shown to a doctor!

20
00:01:43.849 --> 00:01:45.748
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:53.969
Think and answer. What should you do if a dog bites you?

22
00:01:54.019 --> 00:01:55.169
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.405 --> 00:02:01.342
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.392 --> 00:02:04.032
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

